ude testExperimental: AgentTestRunner still collected its telemetry when collectMetadata was true, and MetaDataCollector labeled unlabeled output default. Commit 1 overrides the inherited setting with systemProperty(\"collectMetadata\", false) in both affected variants. Both complete module checks passed with collection enabled; forced reruns of both trace-ID suites passed without creating or modifying any telemetry files.","commit":1,"disposition":"fixed","key":"inline:4266575050"}],"input_identity":{},"outcome":"fixes","request_digest":"d9a4e9bddf4b110a976014403660fb1a1b4a9f3287b6ee39b81cd6ba31d84ccb","schema":2},"download_sha256":"07db2f514258a57893e28f6cbd37d4707cfa0e755a939ff1971754c8f0d4f44c","frozen_sha":"a9f8862f7dbb1a2723b49446046aef62cfd2bf9d","pr":20564,"publication_eligible":false,"repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","request_digest":"d9a4e9bddf4b110a976014403660fb1a1b4a9f3287b6ee39b81cd6ba31d84ccb","request_id":"4192f9582ea240748b99484dc3b8e361","run_attempt":1,"run_id":38511875185,"schema":2,"scope":"Structural/Git verification only. No target code or tests are executed.","server_artifact_digest":"sha256:07db2f514258a57893e28f6cbd37d4707cfa0e755a939ff1971754c8f0d4f44c","verification":"verified","verification_run":{"attempt":1,"id":38514351311},"workflow_revision":"d8cf99923de07725fc1445b4f027c036f709d640"},"request":{"authorized_actor_id":218610,"baseline_review_ids":[5498039544,5510155922,5512063442,5512083911,5512842259],"budgets":{"max_iterations":5,"propagation_seconds":120,"retention_days":14,"worker_timeout_minutes":30},"commit_author":{"id":218610,"login":"trask"},"findings":[{"body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### \ud83d\udfe1 Changes recommended\n\nBoth Tomcat trace-ID variants still inherit metadata collection and can contaminate default metadata.\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>1 open finding</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Disable metadata collection for testExperimental](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/pull/20564#discussion_r4266575050) \u00b7 New\n</details>\n\n\ud83e\udde0 **Review effort:** Balanced","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5512842259","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5512842259},{"body":"[Testing] `testExperimental` is still wired into `check` while inheriting `collectMetadata=true` from `withType<Test>().configureEach`. Because the trace-ID request attribute is only used by the fixture and does not change emitted telemetry, a metadata-enabled `check` will collect this full suite without a label and merge it into `when: default`. Explicitly disable collection for this excluded variant rather than only removing `metadataConfig`.","comment_commit_id":"a9f8862f7dbb1a2723b49446046aef62cfd2bf9d","comment_id":4266575050,"key":"inline:4266575050","kind":"inline","line":66,"original_commit_id":"a9f8862f7dbb1a2723b49446046aef62cfd2bf9d","original_line":66,"path":"instrumentation/tomcat/tomcat-10.0/javaagent/build.gradle.kts","review_commit_id":"a9f8862f7dbb1a2723b49446046aef62cfd2bf9d","review_id":5512842259,"review_submitted_at":"2026-10-14T03:50:31Z","root_author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"thread_context":[{"author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"body_hash":"dd0e6161b52c54190d143663bc0c061d780d6aa2bd86b91ca41d2b6816713fec","id":4266575050,"parent":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-14T03:50:31Z"}],"thread_id":"PRRT_kwDODJKVX86sJ8MN"}],"frozen_at":1791952301,"frozen_at_iso":"2026-10-14T04:31:41Z","frozen_sha":"a9f8862f7dbb1a2723b49446046aef62cfd2bf9d","head_ref":"trask-request-capture-metadata","head_repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","head_repo_id":210933087,"input_mode":"direct","launch_run":{"actor_id":218610,"attempt":1,"id":38511836060},"loop_kind":"copilot_review","metadata":{"body":"<!--\nCHANGELOG.md is generated from merged pull requests. Do not add an entry unless this PR introduces\na deprecation or breaking change.\n-->\n\nMoves optional Servlet and Tomcat request-parameter capture into named test variants so baseline metadata describes instrumentation defaults.\n\nKeeps request-capture and Tomcat trace-ID request-attribute behavioral coverage. Removes the setup-only trace-ID flag from telemetry labels.\n\nExtracted from #20552 to keep the controller work in a separate PR. Refs #20546.","title":"Correct request capture telemetry metadata labels"},"mode":"publish","pr":20564,"protocol":"git-candidate-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fine_grained_pat","authorized_actor_id":218610,"authorized_at":1791952303,"generation":2,"max_pipelines":5,"phase":"87aac08c3f5c4813b9df2b7860a0a090","profile":"git-candidate-v1","required_checks":[]},"repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","repo_id":210933087,"request_id":"4192f9582ea240748b99484dc3b8e361","schema":2,"source_private":false,"target_private":false,"workflow_ref":"review-loop-revisions/d8cf99923de07725fc1445b4f027c036f709d640","workflow_revision":"d8cf99923de07725fc1445b4f027c036f709d640"},"run":{"attempt":1,"conclusion":"success","id":38511875185,"url":"https://github.com/trask/copilot-workflows/actions/runs/38511875185"},"schema":2,"seen_findings":["0e555e698e87f8381dbfabeb41bb8a27e33e6450361aad26c4729c360b65fa15"],"seen_inline_findings":["6e5f88d1c58da27a08cca409f082ca0f81cb190254948f4bea7353778027bbd3"],"seen_missed_findings":[],"stage":"thread_effects","verification_run":{"attempt":1,"id":38514351311}}